== list users
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b1
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b1
  Content-Length: 45
  | [{"id":1,"name":"ada"},{"id":2,"name":"bob"}]
== one user
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b2
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b2
  Content-Length: 20
  | {"id":7,"from":"b2"}
== dead upstream is skipped
  [pool api] b4 refused, out for 3
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b1
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b1
  Content-Length: 20
  | {"id":8,"from":"b1"}
== create
  HTTP/1.1 201 Created
  Server: origin-b2
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b2
  Content-Length: 35
  | {"created":{"name":"cy"},"by":"b2"}
== 503 GET is retried
  [pool api] b1 answered 503, retrying GET
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b2
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b2
  Content-Length: 12
  | steady on b2
== 503 POST is not
  [pool api] b4 refused, out for 3
  HTTP/1.1 503 Service Unavailable
  Server: origin-b1
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b1
  Content-Length: 8
  | draining
== hop-by-hop headers dropped
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b2
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b2
  Content-Length: 97
  | content-length,host,via,x-forwarded-for,x-forwarded-prefix,x-request-id xff=127.0.0.1 prefix=/api
== chunked origin reply
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK
  Server: origin-b1
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  X-Upstream: b1
  Content-Length: 25
  | id,name
1,ada
2,bob
3,cy

== static pool is all down
  [pool static] s1 refused, out for 3
  HTTP/1.1 502 Bad Gateway
  Content-Type: text/plain
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  Content-Length: 29
  | no healthy upstream in static
== longer prefix wins
  HTTP/1.1 502 Bad Gateway
  Content-Type: text/plain
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  Content-Length: 29
  | no healthy upstream in static
== no route
  HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
  Content-Type: text/plain
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  Content-Length: 21
  | no route for /nowhere
== body too large
  HTTP/1.1 413 Payload Too Large
  Content-Type: text/plain
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  Content-Length: 18
  | body over 64 bytes
== malformed
  HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
  Content-Type: text/plain
  Via: 1.1 kproxy
  Content-Length: 16
  | bad request line
